OpenCAD

This repository originates from the first-party OpenCAD/CAD source in the
infra repository's oss-alternatives directory. Original source notices and
the original first-party license-manifest.json are preserved.

The manifest declares cadcore, CAD standards fact data, DXF and vault under
Apache-2.0. CAD standards data contains facts, not standards body text.
The original manifest also describes components outside this migration;
their mention does not mean those components are included here.

No third-party geometry engine, desktop runtime or CAD source is bundled by
the bootstrap. Optional FreeCAD/OpenCascade/OCP and other externally installed
software remain subject to their own licenses and attribution requirements.
The first-party manifest is not a complete third-party SBOM or license audit.

AutoCAD, CATIA, SolidWorks, DXF and other product names belong to their
respective owners. This project does not imply affiliation or endorsement.
